    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A special drawable for handling screen effects. This basically works by taking the screen surface and drawing on itself. Sounds a bit dirty, but works.</para>
<para>The z index is chosen in a way that battle animations and message boxes are not colorized. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
